stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> idle_ready

  idle_ready --> moving: set_preset(preset_in)
  moving --> idle_ready: target_reached
  moving --> idle_ready: stop

  idle_ready --> fault: safety_trigger
  moving --> fault: heartbeat_timeout
  moving --> fault: limit_switch
  moving --> fault: encoder_error
  idle_ready --> fault: encoder_error

  fault --> fault: any_command_except_reset
  fault --> idle_ready: reset

  note right of fault
    Fault is latched.
    Requires explicit reset.
  end note
